      "writtenOn": "2025-06-25T21:23:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the same target quality, if the encoder spends more time encoding an image, it is natural to expect the encoded output should be smaller.\n\nPerhaps speed 7\u0027s output has a slightly better quality?",
